--- !u!114 &5756558219466871695
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2045271958560702184}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 64f369b0c5074c439c4dafb65a54fa21, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcName: niko
  interactDistance: 1.5
  interactKey: 101
  talkIcon: {fileID: 900000000000001003}
  iconBaseLocalPosition: {x: 0, y: 1.05, z: 0}
  iconBobAmplitude: 0.1
  iconBobFrequency: 2.5
  greeting:
  - speaker: NPC_1
    text: 你好，旅行者！欢迎来到我们的村子。
    playerSpeaking: 0
  - speaker: Player
    text: 你好！这里是什么地方？
    playerSpeaking: 1
  - speaker: NPC_1
    text: 这里是我们的家园。村里有任务大厅、商店和通往旷野的道路。旅途中遇到困难，欢迎回来歇歇脚。
    playerSpeaking: 0
  - speaker: Player
    text: 村外安全吗？
    playerSpeaking: 1
  - speaker: NPC_1
    text: 森林里有哥布林出没，出发前检查好生命和装备。看见蘑菇、木材一类的资源，也可以顺手收集起来。
    playerSpeaking: 0
  - speaker: Player
    text: 谢谢提醒，我会小心的。
    playerSpeaking: 1
  - speaker: NPC_1
    text: 祝你好运，冒险者！愿村里的灯火一直为你留着。
    playerSpeaking: 0
